# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# The package description for tools/package.py (NBTFoundry/manager): one argument
# per line. `make package` and the release workflow both use it; they add the
# version, sequence, key, output and executable. Bridge 1.7: the payload is a
# module built with the NBT toolchain, run by NBT Manager's nbt-runner (runner);
# the games come through `files`: cartridges one file each, a Mega-CD disc as a
# game folder (its cue sheet or playlist and tracks: a folder, or a zip archive
# unpacked on import) or one CHD image. Discs come from a USB stick: the phone
# sends at most 64 MiB.
--app
picodrive
--compat
nbt_6.5_armv7
--bridge
1.7
--bridge-uses
show,controller,files,runner
--bridge-optional
status,live-settings,gamepad
--bridge-files
md,gen,smd,bin,32x,sms,gg,sg,sc,cue,iso,chd,m3u,wav,mp3,ogg|1024|16384|folders=m3u,cue
--setting
aspect|Aspect|4-3|4-3,pixel,full
--setting
filter|Filter|sharp|sharp,smooth,nearest
--setting
region|Region|auto|auto,us,europe,japan,japan_pal
--setting
renderer|Renderer|accurate|accurate,good,fast
--setting
sprite_limit|Sprite limit|on|on,off
--setting
recompiler|32X recompiler|on|on,off
--setting
overclock|68000 overclock|off|off,25,50,100
--setting
sound|Sound|on|on,off
--setting
show_fps|Show FPS|off|off,on
--setting
debug_log|Debug log|off|off,on
# What the phone app shows before an install (NBT Manager's PROTOCOL.md,
# "Package information"): the PicoDrive version the pin builds
# (tools/package_version.py: `make package-args`; `make test` checks it), the
# project, the licence and the notices.
--property
PicoDrive|2.05 (1b413e5)
--property
Project|PicoDrive (https://github.com/irixxxx/picodrive)
--property
Licence|PicoDrive licence (non-commercial)
--text
Sega Mega Drive, Mega-CD, 32X, Master System and Game Gear games by PicoDrive, for NBT Manager.
--text=
--text
PicoDrive and its CPU cores may be shared only free of charge: no sale, no commercial use (their licences).
--text
FAME Motorola 68000 Emulation Library by Oscar Orallo. CZ80 by Stephane Dallongeville.
--text
No game or BIOS is included.
--text=
--text
Source, licences and notices: https://github.com/NBTFoundry/nf-picodrive
